  "text": "\r\n\t\t Calendar • VotingWorks Test \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Budget Resources   \t\t\t \n     Infrastructure  \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \nHome \nCalendar \r\nCalendar\t   \r\nView All Calendars is the default. Choose Select a Calendar to view a specific calendar. Subscribe to calendar notifications by clicking on the Notify Me® button, and you will automatically be alerted about the latest events in our community.    \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t List \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Week \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Month \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  Notify Me® \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  Print \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  Subscribe to iCalendar \nSearch Calendars by: \r\n\t\t Start Date \t\t \t\t \r\n\t\t End Date \t\t \t\t \r\n\t\t Enter Search Terms \t\t \r\n\t Show Past Events \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Select a Calendar \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Select Calendar/Calendars to filter \r\n            All Calendars\r\nBoard of Selectmen\r\nCemetery Trustees\r\nCommittees\r\nCommunity Development\r\nConservation Commission\r\nCrystal Lake Park Events\r\nHoliday/Office Closures\r\nMain Calendar\r\nTown Clerk/Tax Collector\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Search \r\n\t\t   Return to Previous \r\nEvent Details \r\n         View Map \r\nGoogle \nBing \r\nDate: \r\nOctober 23, 2026 \r\n2026-10-23T11:00:00 \r\nTime: \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t11:00 AM - 3:00 PM\r\nLocation: \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tClerk's Office\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nAddress: \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t 503 Province Rd \nGilmanton ,  NH   03237 \r\nVotingWorks Test \r\nFriday, October 23, 2026 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTesting of the VotingWorks Ballot Machine for the State General will be held at the Clerk's office, in the Academy Building, from 11am until completion on Friday 10/23/2026.\r\n         Map \r\n        \t Agenda 